    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> is a fast-paced ultraviolent elemental FPS set in a unique world where the entirety of history has been re-written. Rip your way through augmented humans, monsters, and demons to tear apart an evil cult that controls the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.poster.avif?t=1755029168\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.webm?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.mp4?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>four elements</strong> in unique ways to brutally kill enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities together to form even stronger abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANIPULATE </strong>abilities mid-flight to make them more powerful and gain fine control over their movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies in <strong>complex </strong>or <strong>stylish </strong>ways to temporarily increase your brain power, granting access to even more powerful abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely in any direction, both inside and outside of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies by soaring above them with <strong>Flame Propulsion</strong>, or quickly evade attacks by <strong>Dashing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the four elements for additional unique movement abilities as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> has a detailed multi-layered story set in a dark fantasy world where the entirety of planet Earth got Isekai'd. The story is told through dialogue, hidden books, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.poster.avif?t=1755029168\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.webm?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.mp4?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> is a fast-paced ultraviolent elemental FPS set in a unique world where the entirety of history has been re-written. Rip your way through augmented humans, monsters, and demons to tear apart an evil cult that controls the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.poster.avif?t=1755029168\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.webm?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.mp4?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>four elements</strong> in unique ways to brutally kill enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities together to form even stronger abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANIPULATE </strong>abilities mid-flight to make them more powerful and gain fine control over their movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies in <strong>complex </strong>or <strong>stylish </strong>ways to temporarily increase your brain power, granting access to even more powerful abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely in any direction, both inside and outside of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies by soaring above them with <strong>Flame Propulsion</strong>, or quickly evade attacks by <strong>Dashing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the four elements for additional unique movement abilities as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> has a detailed multi-layered story set in a dark fantasy world where the entirety of planet Earth got Isekai'd. The story is told through dialogue, hidden books, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.poster.avif?t=1755029168\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.webm?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.mp4?t=1755029168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
